{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkcjFoVq5ZYNn7R7FTfn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm going with a Pesagot (פסגות) account and the Yelin Lapidot S&P 500 tracker fund (ילין לפידות מחקה S&P 500, 4D, number 5139282). The page says I'd have about 86,500 ₪ after ten years, but that's for 10,000 ₪ up front plus 500 a month. With my 30,000 it should be more. I'm fairly sure about the account and the fund, and less sure about the amount.\n\nWhat decided it: the page marks Pesagot with \"★ הזול\" (cheapest) and puts it first. Its fee is 1,057 ₪ over 10 years, against 4,541 ₪ at Leumi. Seeing it in shekels made the difference real. The fund shows \"דמי ניהול 0%\", so that one was easy.\n\n**Where I looked, in order:**\n- **Top of the page:** the heading \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד\" looked like exactly what I came for. S&P 500 was already selected. The amount boxes showed 10,000 now, 500 a month, 10 years and 7%. The big result was 86,492 ₪ \"נשאר לכם בעוד 10 שנים, אחרי דמי ניהול ומס\", against 70,000 ₪ put in.\n- **Fund list (left):** Yelin Lapidot is first and marked \"הבחירה\". The rest are just more S&P funds.\n- **Account list (right):** Pesagot 86,492, Leumi 83,396, Mizrahi lower down. A few at the bottom drop to about 63,000.\n- **Where I stopped:** the \"מה הכי משנה\" chart and table. \"שנים 12 → 19,116 ₪ יותר\" was the only line that stuck: staying longer gets you more.\n\n**What I skipped:** the coloured cost bar and its legend, the long grey account notes (\"לא בחישוב…\"), the foreign ETF rows (\"אין מחיר כאן\"), the \"עם נטרול מט\"ח\" block, the paragraph explaining the list, and everything below the table.\n\n**Where I got stuck:**\n- I can't change the 10,000 to my 30,000 here, so the 86,492 isn't really my number.\n- 70,000 growing to 86,492 at 7% for 10 years looked small to me. I'd expected about 70% more. Maybe \"בכסף של היום\" (in today's money) shrinks it. I didn't work it out.\n- I've seen Pesagot around but it isn't my bank. Leumi is only about 3,000 less and feels safer to me.\n- The \"מול המדד\" (vs. the index) numbers jump around, e.g. \"+0.37%\" with a \"1 שנה\" next to it. I didn't get what that column was telling me.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** דמי משמרת, נאמן, צוברת / מחלקת דיבידנד, עקבת החלף, מנוטרלת מט\"ח, \"חשיפה לדולר\", \"סוג 4D / 4A\", \"אין שנה מלאה\".\n\n**What I'd change:**\n- Put \"the cheapest account + fund for you\" in one line at the very top.\n- Let me type my own amount as the obvious first step.\n- Most of the tags on the fund rows are noise to me. Cut them.\n- The ranges with minus signs (\"בין +2,212 ל־ −23,766\") put me off that fund completely."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1844,"cache_read_input_tokens":13870,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1844},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01372b28-5009-494f-9f41-d500cf793ab8","uuid":"2d9f17d1-9bd9-4d01-879a-a5625e28bbbb","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:04:11.230Z","request_id":"req_011CgkcjFZ6zj5WHQvVnPYFU"}
